<div n="3" type="jArticle"><dateline>&#xFFFC; <hi rendition="#b">Berlin,</hi> 12. Dec.</dateline> <p>Nach der &#x201E;Nordd. Allg. Ztg.&#x201C; &#x017F;ind<lb/>
