<div n="3" type="jArticle"><dateline><gap unit="chars" quantity="1" reason="illegible"/> <hi rendition="#b">Karlsruhe,</hi> 12. Dec.</dateline> <p>Die <hi rendition="#g">Handelskammer</hi> will<lb/>
